# Dashboard state: run history and the chat transcript. Written on every
# invocation, so committing it would churn the diff on every demo. The curated
# evidence under evidence/discovery, evidence/replay and evidence/escalation
# stays tracked -- that is the deliverable; this is a convenience that lets a
# demo survive a restart.
evidence/dashboard/
